Updated {{month_year}} with current certified market inventory for white gold marquise settings — 60 settings mapped from $860 to $9,115 across every style (solitaire, halo, hidden halo, three-stone, pavé, bezel, cathedral, vintage, east-west). Added the Rhodium Wear Timeline, the G-Color Minimum Rule, and the Lifetime Replating Cost framework after reviewing 150+ white gold maintenance conversations with clients over 2 years. The consistent finding is that buyers underestimate rhodium maintenance until year 3 when the warming becomes visible. Our pick remains the Petite Solitaire in 14k White Gold at $1,000 for daily wear + the Petite Micropavé Hidden Halo at $1,430 for hidden halo buyers.

